151
00:08:03,533 --> 00:08:16,313
I can't believe you did it again, are we?

152
00:08:16,973 --> 00:08:18,613
It's just like last year.

153
00:08:21,413 --> 00:08:24,233
Almost all of the candidates had lost the will to keep fighting.

154
00:08:24,233 --> 00:08:26,693
Then there was you.

155
00:08:28,193 --> 00:08:29,493
You never gave up.

156
00:08:29,993 --> 00:08:31,353
You just kept on running.

157
00:08:32,193 --> 00:08:33,493
You forged a new path.

158
00:08:33,973 --> 00:08:34,853
The way you did today,

159
00:08:35,453 --> 00:08:36,613
and right behind you,

160
00:08:36,973 --> 00:08:38,453
